  "description": "At Hertiar Academy, exclusive to the elite, Jeremy, the troubled heir of the Hertiar family, becomes dangerously fixated on Lucian. When Daniel arrives and discovers Lucian is the one he's admired for years, he ignores warnings and befriends him. Consumed by jealousy, Jeremy openly displays affection for Lucian in front of Daniel, trying to drive a wedge between them. One who can have everything except the one he wants. One who would like nothing more than to leave. And one who is determined to save his friend. Just who will come out on top of this struggle of love? \n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: Includes five extra chapters.*",
